        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-13T23:10:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Other devices that want to interoperate with one of our devices on the basis of the vendor should be looking for our VID, which is not changing here. I think all of the devices being updated here are demo boards or developer tools specific to CrOS, which means there shouldn\u0027t be much in the ecosystem that wants to interoperate with them anyway.\n\nThis seems safe to me.",
      "parentUuid": "157816ec_df7f0575",
      "revId": "8128bf3ca39edb908a608b4cfb3cf93266dd554c",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4d2c46c6_cc12a808",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-13T23:10:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I will note that, if your goal is to update the information actually displayed by devices in the field (mostly our own labs) when they enumerate, you will need to cherry pick this change to several firmware branches and communicate with the branch maintainers (mostly the test team) about the process for updating these boards.",
      "revId": "8128bf3ca39edb908a608b4cfb3cf93266dd554c",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
